title: Agricultural Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: agricultural_policy_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: rsdrp_in_government = 1 and (agriculture_minister_party = "RSDRP") and agricultural_policy_timer == 0
card-image: img/portraits/maslov.jpg
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
#subtitle: Issues of farmer financing, grain purchasing, and land reform.

= Agricultural Policy

While agricultural policy has historically not been the domain of the RSDRP, there is much need for policy in this area. Our urban constituencies hope for cheaper and more stable food supplies, while small farmers need economic relief. There is also the movement for land reform, to break up the large aristocratic estates and redistribute land to peasants.

- @land_policy
- @agricultural_finance
- @pro_consumer
- @state_buyer
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@land_policy
title: Land Reforms
subtitle: Review various land reforms
unavailable-subtitle: [? if budget <= 0 : We do not have the money to pursue any reforms at this time. ?] [? if judicial_reform < 2 : The judiciary would never allow this. ?]
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 2 and budget > 0

- @eserlandref
- @municipalizeland
- @nationalizeland
- @return: Return to larger agricultural policy.

@eserlandref
title: Agricultural 
subtitle: -1 budget - We should heed the concerns of the PSR and implement Narodist reform.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; land_reform += 1; coalition_dissent += 1; rural_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_nts -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 1 if unemployed >= 5; kadets_relation -= 4; psr_relation += 4; left_dissent += 5; rural_sol += 3; rural_policy += 1;

By socializing swathes of farmland that was previously held by estates, magnates, and large farmers, we have fallen in line with the PSR's rural policy, handing the the newly acquired farmland to local communes, villages, and communities for oversight, governance, and ownership.

@municipalizeland
title: Municipalization
subtitle: -1 budget - We will pursue the municipalization of land.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival:budget -= 1; land_reform += 1; coalition_dissent += 1; rural_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_nts -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 1 if unemployed >= 5; kadets_relation -= 4; psr_relation -= 4; rural_sol += 3; rural_policy += 1; coup_progress += 1; agriculture_goal_completed += 1;

By buying and municipalizing swathes of farmland that was previously held by estates. magnates, and large farmers, we have brought Marxism to the countryside! The newly acquired farmland will be owned and administered by regional states and municipalities.

@nationalizeland
title: Nationalize the land.
subtitle: -1 budget - We shall seek to nationalize the land.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; land_reform += 1; coalition_dissent += 1; rural_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_nts -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 1 if unemployed >= 5; kadets_relation -= 8; psr_relation -= 6; left_strength += 8; left_dissent -= 5; rural_sol += 3; rural_policy += 1; coup_progress += 2; agriculture_goal_completed += 1;

By nationalizing swathes of farmland that previously held by estates, magnates, and large farmers, we have brought Marxism to the countryside! The newly acquired farmland will be owned and governed by the state. The Party Left has begun to celebrate, while the Narodists and Liberals are left unhappy.

@agricultural_finance
title: Agricultural Financing
subtitle: -1 budget - Increase financing for agricultural credit and insurance.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; agricultural_finance += 1; rural_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_nts -= 3*(1-dissent); peoples_party_support += 1; center_dissent += 5; left_dissent += 4; rural_sol += 4; rural_policy += 1; economic_growth += 0.2;

We have increased financial support for small farmers, providing access to credit and insurance, saving them from privatization. The left and center of our party are opposed to our rural policy, seeing these policies as giveaways to peasant farmers.

@pro_consumer
title: Food Procurement
subtitle: -1 budget - Provide inexpensive food for workers.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; pro_consumer += 1; workers_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent); workers_sol += 4; coalition_dissent += 1 if black_thursday_seen; economic_growth += 0.2;

We have increased state purchasing of food staples to provide to urban workers and the poor. This benefits workers more than it benefits farmers, as we are negotiating for lower purchase prices. [? if black_thursday_seen and (in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition) : Our coalition partners consider this policy to be a wasteful handout. ?]

@state_buyer
title: State Buyer
subtitle: -2 budget - Create a state monopoly for grain purchases, guaranteeing prices for farmers and stable prices for consumers. [? if judicial_reform < 2 : The judiciary would never allow this. ?]
choose-if: budget >= 2 and judicial_reform >= 2
on-arrival: budget -= 2; state_buyer = 1; rural_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_nts -= 3*(1-dissent); workers_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if (in_grand_coalition or in_weimar_coalition); kadets_relation -= 5; psr_relation -= 3; peoples_party_support += 1; rural_policy += 2; capital_strike_progress += 1; economic_growth += 0.4;
max-visits: 1

Our new purchasing agency guarantees fair prices for farmers, while also providing lower food prices for workers and the urban poor. This policy necessitates heavy spending and an unprecedented level of state intervention in the economy, raising the ire of liberal economists.
